  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tropical Cyclone Harold Recovery Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment is supporting Vanuatu&apos;s recovery from Tropical Cyclone Harold which struck Vanuatu in April 2020 as a Category 5 cyclone. It is aligned with Vanuatu&apos;s National Recovery Strategy &apos;Yumi Evriwan Tugeta&apos;. The investment is supporting the restoration of Vanuatu&apos;s health and education facilities, improving water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) in health, education and community facilities, and is promoting economic recovery and employment.</narrative>
  </description>
